(7803108, 1301908, 12200, '<td valign="top">
This was among my favorites in the challenge. The clarity and color really make for an attractive composition for my eye. It also helps that the two leaves are placed without distraction and are of near-identical size. The placement on the tree makes it unclear to me whether this was a "found" natural growth or two curated leaves carefully placed for the juxtaposition. Not that it matters, visually, but I''d be interested to know. :-)</td>', 'This was among my favorites in the challenge. The clarity and color really make for an attractive composition for my eye. It also helps that the two leaves are placed without distraction and are of near-identical size. The placement on the tree makes it unclear to me whether this was a "found" natural growth or two curated leaves carefully placed for the juxtaposition. Not that it matters, visually, but I''d be interested to know. :-)', '2025-11-26 04:51:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(7803109, 1301854, 12200, '<td valign="top">
